      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 1,
      "original_position": 1,
      "content": "请使用技能「imap-smtp-email」协助当前任务。\n我要发送【126邮件】，请引导我获取授权码，然后发送邮件给我自己：主题【测试】，内容【测试】"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_db4d78062400:msg_4",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 10229,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 4,
      "original_position": 2,
      "content": "好的，我来帮你发送126邮件。先检查下邮件技能是否已配置。"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_db4d78062400:msg_7",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 10230,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 7,
      "original_position": 3,
      "content": "还没有配置126邮箱。我先引导你获取授权码，然后帮你配置并发送。\n\n---\n\n## 📧 配置 126 邮箱 — 请先获取授权码\n\n126邮箱不能直接使用登录密码，需要生成一个 **授权码（Authorization Code）**。\n\n### 请按以下步骤操作：\n\n1. **登录 126 邮箱网页版** → [mail.126.com](https://mail.126.com)\n2. 进入 **设置 → POP3/SMTP/IMAP**\n3. 开启 **IMAP/SMTP 服务**\n4. 点击 **\"新增授权码\"**（会要求短信验证）\n5. 系统会生成一串 **授权码**（类似 `ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP`）\n\n### 拿到授权码后，请回复我以下信息：\n\n> **你的 126 邮箱地址：** [例如: ***@***]  \n> **获取到的授权码：** [例如: ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP]\n\n收到后我立即帮你配置并发送测试邮件给你自己！"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_db4d78062400:msg_8",
      "role": "user",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 10231,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": "2026-06-28T17:16:31.373Z",
      "dated_source_position": 2314,
      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 8,
      "original_position": 4,
      "content": "***@*** [邮件凭据已隐藏]"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_db4d78062400:msg_9",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 10232,
      "source_file": "messages",
